    "en": "Colorion Text Effects is a comprehensive creative repository of animated typography styles and copy-paste CSS/JS text effects. Ranging from neon letter glows and glitch typography to rainbow gradients and kinetic hover shifts, it supplies instant visual drama for headlines.",
